//! A headless gate for the FileSystem package: the native dialog shim links,
//! and its one non-blocking answer crosses the boundary as a Kira String.
//!
//! It prints the chooser this build talks to, and opens no dialog.

import FileSystem

/// Prints the chooser this build talks to: `windows`, `macos`, `portal` or `none`.
@Main
function main() {
    print(FileSystem.dialogBackend())
}
